Swoole with the coroutine PDO SQLite: the module swoole of php82-swoole built
with --enable-swoole-sqlite, linked with the SQLite of az (libsqlite3).
With the hook SWOOLE_HOOK_PDO_SQLITE (in SWOOLE_HOOK_ALL) the calls of PDO
SQLite run in the thread pool of swoole, so a query waits in its
coroutine only, not the whole worker; without the hook they run directly.
swoole registers its own copy of the PDO driver sqlite in the place of
that of php82-pdo_sqlite, which it replaces when php82-pdo_sqlite is
loaded first (ext-30-pdo_sqlite.ini comes before ext-30-swoole.ini).
One of php82-swoole and php82-swoole-sqlite: the same files.

PECL swoole for php82 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/swoole of the
release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20220829/swoole.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d.
